ico e sustentabilidade.\n\nO condomínio oferece portaria 24h garantindo tranquilidade, salão de festas e espaço comum para reformar.\n\nUma casa que une sofisticação, espaço e contato com a natureza.  \n\nAgende sua visita e descubra tudo o que este imóvel pode oferecer!\n\nParcerias são bem vindas!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1a6a154e-6bab-4fd1-8c6a-84c64661cc96.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c22d5e90-bae9-4dd9-9a53-7ad02bf7e0c5.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0bd9b71d-ef31-49dc-a262-2bd4f9184b65.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/dcce8c19-7b13-4c0c-b0a2-c74960914a40.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f21b9077-4fc5-41bd-8558-9fc8adbba4e7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6fa5014e-d2da-461e-b363-174b58f05403.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3fffa829-4d66-43ab-8e49-b5c16497764f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/89d904a2-af1d-4656-b9ea-bd3f5cec2b92.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/493812e7-49a6-414e-acf1-9c047b98a81b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c3c29c78-d679-44ae-8912-556fe055bc61.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a2d8e09522be24fa2247ea6/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8685d911-08a1-45a2-b0ba-ca1ad85af777.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.co